  "details": "An avatar previously worked normally, but now causes crash.\n\nIt can be avoided by disabling Animation with the safety system.\n\nIt maybe occurs in other avatars.\n\nAvatar: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_dcf7bbbb-0096-4888-8eb2-6470ff716c4e\n\n(I reported to the author to unpublish the avatar.)\n\nVersion: Build 1320(Live), 1330(Open beta), and IK beta\n\n08/05 14:52 update: the avatar made private by author however other avatars may have same problem because the crash seems to be made by broken Animator handling...",
